{"features":[{"feature_idx":0,"name":"en","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":1,"name":"wo","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":2,"name":"non_standardized","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}}],"rows":[{"row_idx":800,"row":{"en":"It's a real treasure, and I'm sure it will remain in my family for many years to come.","wo":"Lii xéewal dëgg la, te gëm naani dina ñu ko yàgga tëye ci famiy bi ay at ci kanam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLii heuwal deug la té geum nani dina gnouko yague teuye si famille bi ay att si kanam\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":801,"row":{"en":"This tool allows you to search by surname, first name, and date of birth.","wo":"Jumtukaay boobu daf lay may nga seetee ci sant, tur, ak bisu juddu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJumtoukay bobou daf lay may nga seté ci sant, tour, ak bissou dioudou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":802,"row":{"en":"Are you getting enough exercise?","wo":"Ndax yaa ngi tàggat sa yaram lu doy?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdakh yagui taggat sa yaram lou doy ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":803,"row":{"en":"Valve position is determined by flow rate demand (differential pressure).","wo":"Càkkutéefu debit (presioŋ biy wuutale) bi mooy wane fi vanne bi wara nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThiakouteufou débit (pression biy woutalé) bi moy wané fi vanne bi wara neuk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":804,"row":{"en":"In 1937, she set out on an around-the-world flight with navigator Fred Noonan.","wo":"Ci 1937, muni dafay naaw wër àdduna bi ànd ci ak navigateur bu tuddu Fred Noonan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi 1937, mouni dafay naaw weur addouna bi ande ci ak navigateur bou toudou Fred Noonan.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":805,"row":{"en":"They are all having a lot of fun, and they are working together as a team.","wo":"Ñoo néppay bokk di bége lu bari, bokk liggéey ci benn ekip.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGno népay bokk di bégué lou bari, bok liguey thi bene ekib.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":806,"row":{"en":"The study, which was conducted by researchers at the University of California, San Francisco, found that one in five women who underwent a mammogram had a false positive result.","wo":"Gëstu bi boroom xam-xam yu bokk ci University of California, San Francisco amal, dafa wane ni su amee juróomi jigéen ñu def mamograam, masin bi dina juum ci kenn ci ñoom niko am nga cancer fekk amul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGuestou bi borom kham kham you bok thi university of california san francisco amal dafa wané ni sou amé diouromi djiguéne gnou def mamogram machine bi dina dioum thi kene ci gnom niko am nga cancer fek amoul.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":807,"row":{"en":"One of the students, named Ayanda, is new to the school, and she is not very good at basketball.","wo":"Mu am kenn ci ndongo yi ku tuddu Ayanda, ku bees la ci daara ji, te aayul noonu ci basket.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou ame kene ci ndongo yi kou toudou Ayanda, kou bess la si daara dji, te aayoul nonou si basket.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":808,"row":{"en":"The flavors of the meat, vegetables, and cheese all combined perfectly to create a taste that Juan had never experienced before.","wo":"Cafka yàpp, lujum yi ak fromaas yiñ ci boole dañu ko jox cafka gu neex gu amul fenn gu Juan ci boppam musul ñam fenn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThiafka yap, lidioum yi ak fromag yi gnou si boolé daniou ko diokh thiafka gou nekh gou amoul feun gou Juan si bopam meusseul niam feun.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":809,"row":{"en":"We talked about the future.","wo":"Nu waxtaane sunu ëlëg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou wakhtané souniou euleuk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":810,"row":{"en":"Next, you'll need to clip your dog's nails in a comfortable place.","wo":"Li ci topp mooy nga fexe sooy dagg we yi nga moytu dagg fu koy gaañ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLii si top moy nga fekhé sooy dague wé yi nga moytou dague fou koy gnagne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":811,"row":{"en":"Kosher foods are those that are considered to be fit for consumption according to Jewish law.","wo":"Ñami Kosher ñooy ñam yiñ wax ni mën nañu ko lekk te dëppoo ak yoonu divine Juif yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnami Kosher gnoy gniam yign wakh ni meun nagnou ko lekk té deupoo ak yonou divine Juif yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":812,"row":{"en":"There’s something outside, she says. Something big.","wo":"Muni, amna lu nekk ci biti, lu ponkal la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoungui né amna lou nek thi biti, lou ponkal leu.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":813,"row":{"en":"I follow her gaze out the window.","wo":"Ma xool fimu xool ci palanteer bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa khol fimou khol thi palanteer bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":814,"row":{"en":"The air was thick with the smell of sweat and freshly cut grass as the athletes lined up for the start of the 100-meter dash.","wo":"Foofu yépp a ngi doon xeeñ xetu ñaq ak ñax mu ñu doon sooga dagg, atlet yi nekk ci seeni rëdd ngir daw 100 metre bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFoofou yeup a ngui doon kheegn kheutou gnak ak gnakh mou niou doon soga dagg, atlet yi neuk ci seeni reud nguir daw 100 metre bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":815,"row":{"en":"privacy","wo":"lu mu yàgg yàgg","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nlou mou yagg yagg\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":816,"row":{"en":"The students all celebrate, and they are all very happy.","wo":"Ndongo yépp tëb di dal, ñépp kontaan lool.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdongo yeup teub di dal nieup kontane lole.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":817,"row":{"en":"The combination is simply irresistible.","wo":"Njaxas moomu neexul muñ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdiahas momou nekhoul mougn.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":818,"row":{"en":"liquid","wo":"luy faral di am","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nlouy faral di ame\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":819,"row":{"en":"Second, it can prevent us from seeing the true value of something.","wo":"Ñaareel ba mooy daf lay tere gis lu baax ci moom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNiarel ba moy daf lay tere guiss lou bakh si mom.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":820,"row":{"en":"When you cheat, you're not just cheating yourself, you're also cheating everyone else who has worked hard to learn the material.","wo":"Sooy njuuj njaaj ci sa dundu, sa bopp kese ngay yàqal, yaa ngi yàqalaale keneen ku liggéey bu baax, jàng limu wara jàng.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSooy gnoudj ndiadj si sa doundou sa bopp kessé ngay yakhalé ya ngui yakhalalé kénéne kou liguey bou bakh diangue limou wara diangue\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":821,"row":{"en":"My research has been published in leading journals in the field of linguistics, and I have presented my work at conferences around the world.","wo":"Fësal nañu sama gëstu ci surnaal bi gëna mag biy wax ci wàllu linguistic, te itam fësal naa sama liggéey ci conference yu mag ci àdduna bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFeussal nagnou sama guestou si journal bi gueuna mag bi wakh si wallou linguistique té itame feussal naa sama liguey si conférence you mag si addouna bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":822,"row":{"en":"At first, I don’t see anything.","wo":"Bima njëkkee xool gisuma dara.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBima ndieuké khol guissouma dara.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":823,"row":{"en":"To discover these traits, we administer the most comprehensive and thorough scholarship selection process in Canada.","wo":"Ngir gis màndarga yi, danuy amal tànneef bu leer te jub ci burse yi ñiy joxe ci Canada.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNgir guiss màndarga yi daniouy amal tanef bou leer té djoub si bourse yi gniiy diokhé si canada.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":824,"row":{"en":"Stores selling nonessential goods were ordered closed, putting a crimp in Christmas shopping.","wo":"Màngasin yi doon lu mëna ñàkk ci dundu, dañu leen sant ñu tëj, moo tax bitigu noel yi tëj.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMagasin yi done lou meuna gnak si doundou, daniou len sant niou teudj, mo takh bitik noel yi teudj.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":825,"row":{"en":"It can be caused by a number of things, including eating spicy or fatty foods, drinking alcohol, or taking certain medications.","wo":"Liko mana waral barina, lu ci melni lekk lu saf, wala ñam yu niin, naan alkol, wala jël yenn garab yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nliko mana waral barina lou thi melni lekk lou saff wala niam you niine nane alcool wala dieul yenn garab yi\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":826,"row":{"en":"Congratulations, you’ve just changed your default email signature!","wo":"Jërejëff, soppi leegi sa anamu siife say bataaxal bi fiy baaxoo nekk!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDieureudieuf sopi légui sa anamou siifé say bataakhal bi fiy bahoo neuk!\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":827,"row":{"en":"Fatima Messaoudi: I'm an actor and a furniture designer. I'm also passionate about flowers, especially those that bloom in the winter.","wo":"Fatima Messaoudi: Man aktris laa ba noppi damay defar ay fotëy. Ku bëgg flër laa itam, rawatina flër yiy génn ci hiver bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFatima Messaoudi: mane actrice la ba nopi damay defar ay photo yi. Kou beug fleur la itam, rawatina fleur yiy guenn ci hiver bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":828,"row":{"en":"regularly","wo":"lu faral di am","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nlou faral di ame\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":829,"row":{"en":"Once out of the valley, it is easy sailing on windy trails home.","wo":"Soo xasee ba génne ci vale bi, ñibi dafa yomb soo jaare ci yoon wi am ngelaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo khassé ba guéné thi valé bi gnibi dafa yombe so diarée thi yone wi ame ngélaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":830,"row":{"en":"I turned to the artist, a young man named Ram. You must stop sculpting, I said.","wo":"Ma wëlbatiku ci xale bu góor bu tuddu Ram. Mani ko, Danga wara bàyyi yatt.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa weulbatikou thi khalé bou goor bou toudou Ram. Mani ko Danga wara bayi yatt.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":831,"row":{"en":"Bring the milk to a boil and add the Ragi paste slowly, stirring repeatedly.","wo":"Baxalal meew mi nga sotti ndànk pat Ragi ba noppi nga gaaw yëngal ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBakhalal méw mi nga sotti ndankh pat Ragi ba nopi nga gaw yeungal ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":832,"row":{"en":"She's lying on her side and her two front legs are extended in front of her.","wo":"Mingi tëddee wet, ba noppi tàllal ñaari tànki kanam yi ci kanamam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoungui teudé wét, ba noppi talal gnari tanki kanam yi thi kanamam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":833,"row":{"en":"They feel like it makes us untrustworthy, selfish, spoiled, and rude.","wo":"Dañu melni loolu dafay tax nekk ñu ñàkk njariñ, ñu gàtt xel, ñu xamadi, ñu reew.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDagnou melni lolou dafay takh nek gnou gnak ndiarigne, gnou gate khel, gnou khamadi, gnou rew.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":834,"row":{"en":"Rebecca is tortured and interrogated, but she refuses to give up any information.","wo":"Dóor nañu Rebecca bëggon mu wax, waaye nangu wu leen jox benn xibaar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDoor nagnou rebecca beugone mou wakh wayé nangou wou len diokh bene khibaar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":835,"row":{"en":"The colors of the world swirled around him, and he felt a sense of freedom and joy that he had never experienced before.","wo":"Meloy àdduna bi daal di koy wër, mu yëg lu melni ku moom boppam ak bànneex bumu musul yëg ci dundam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeloy addouna bi daal dikoy weur mou yeug lou melni kou moom boppam ak baneh boumou meusseul yeug si doundam\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":836,"row":{"en":"The rising temperatures and changing precipitation patterns are making it more difficult to grow crops in some areas, while at the same time creating new opportunities for agriculture in other areas.","wo":"Tàngoor wiy gëna yokk, ak coppite yi am ci taw yi dañu gëna jafeel mbay mi ci yenn gox yi, waaye ci jamono jooju, ci yeneen gox, nit ñaa ngi wut yeneen pexe yu bees yu jëm ci wàllu mbay mi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTangor wiy geuna yokk ak coppité yi am thi taw yi daniou geuna diaffél mbay mi thi yenn gox yi wayé thi diamono diodiou thi yenen gox nitt gna ngui wout yenen pékhé you bess you dieum thi wallou mbay mi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":837,"row":{"en":"Yes, you can, but be gentle, Mommy said The leaves are fragile.","wo":"Yaay ji tontu, waaw, mën nga laal waaye ndànk rek, balaa nga leen di gaañ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYaye dji tontou, waw meun nga lal wayé ndank rek, bala nga len di gagné.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":838,"row":{"en":"He landed on a branch nearby and listened to what they were saying.","wo":"Mu wàcci ci bànxaas bu leen jege ba noppi di deglu liñ doon wax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou wathié thi bankhass bou léne diegué ba noppi di déglou lign done wakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":839,"row":{"en":"I cherish my diary but hold every other document in contempt.","wo":"Sama surnaal mooma gëna neex waaye damay sàmm bu baax sama yeneen këyit.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama journal moma geuna nekh wayé damay sam bou bakh sama yénéne keuyit.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":840,"row":{"en":"The Earth was the third planet from the sun.","wo":"Su jogee ci jant bi, Suuf si mooy ñatteelu planet bi ngay jot.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou djogué ci jant bi souf si moy niateleu planete bi ngay dioté\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":841,"row":{"en":"The old man's spirit was there with them, and they knew that he would be happy to see them celebrating his life.","wo":"Góor gu mag gaa ngi woon ci xel ak xolu ñépp, te xam nañu ni dina kontaan bu gisee ñu màggal génnug àddunaam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGoor gou mag gaa ngui wone thi hel ak kholou gnép té kham nagnou ni dina contane bou guissé gnou maggal guénoug adounam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":842,"row":{"en":"The cat is clearly struggling, but it keeps trying, and the whole thing is just so funny.","wo":"Muus maa ngi doon def lépp lumu mën, xàddiwul, soo koy seetaan dafay xoromu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMouss moungui done def lepp loumou meun khadiwoul soko setane dafay khoromou\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":843,"row":{"en":"But there is no test to determine whether the eggs are good quality.","wo":"Waaye amul test ngir xam ndax nen yi baaxna ñu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé amoul test nguir kham ndakh nen yi bakhna gnou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":844,"row":{"en":"Trump also criticized some news media coverage of the coronavirus.","wo":"Trump doon na ñaawlu itam ni yenn media yi doon waxee ci coronavirus bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTrump done na gnawlou itame ni yenn média yi done wakhee thi coronavirus bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":845,"row":{"en":"After several weeks, Rebecca is finally released from prison.","wo":"Ñu tëye Rebecca ayu-bis yu bari, daal di koy génne kaso.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou teuye rebecca ayou biss you bari daldi koy guéné kasso bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":846,"row":{"en":"I feel like all eligible bachelors want to stalk me, and I tell them I am a widow, but they are still in pursuit.","wo":"Daa melni selibateer doxaankat yépp a may topp, neenaa leen damay ténji waaye daxul dellu ginaaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDaa melni selibataire dokhaankat yeup a may top, néna len damay tendji wayé dakhoul dellou guinaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":847,"row":{"en":"I'm enclosing this postcard with a picture of the beach where I'm staying.","wo":"Maa ngi boole ci bataaxal bii, nataalu tefes gi ma nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoungui boolé ci batahal bii, natallou teufess gui ma nekk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":848,"row":{"en":"Member physicians and researchers develop widely recognized clinical practice guidelines.","wo":"Medecin yi ak gëstukat yi ci bokk dañu tëral seeni sàrti bopp yu baax te ñépp nawloo ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMédecin yi ak guestoukat yi si bok daniou teureul séni sarti bopp you bakh té nieup nawlo ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":849,"row":{"en":"The parameters of these structures controlled the ways they functioned, and induced responses that changed the voltage.","wo":"Reglage u jumtukaay yii ñoo yor anam wi ñuy doxee, ba noppi ñu boole ci saafara yuñ wàññi voltage bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRéglage you jumtoukay yii nio yor anam wi niouy dokhé ba noppi gnou boolé si safara yougnou wagnii voltage bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":850,"row":{"en":"Einstein was a pacifist and a strong advocate for social justice.","wo":"Einstein nitu jàmm la woon daan xeex ngir ñépp bokk yam ci yoon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nEinstein nittou diam la wone dane khekh nguir gneup bokk yam si yone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":851,"row":{"en":"The man looked at her, his expression hard.","wo":"Ku góor ki daaldi koy xool ak kanam gu ñàng.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou goor ki daldi koy khol ak kanam gou gnang.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":852,"row":{"en":"Dear [Name], I hope this letter finds you well.","wo":"Salaam [Tur], Mbaa yaa ngi ci jàmm bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSalaam [Tur], Mbaa ya ngui thia diam bou bakh ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":853,"row":{"en":"They are amazed by how small and insignificant they feel compared to the vastness of the universe.","wo":"Ñu yéemu bi ñu gisee niñu tuutee ak ni univers bi rëyee ba jéggi dayo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou yeumou bi gnou guissé nignou touté ak ni univers bi reuye ba diegui dayo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":854,"row":{"en":"Use fresh basil, flax oil, or virgin coconut oil and replace the cheese with yeast.","wo":"Jëfandikool ngun-ngun bu bees, diwu lin wala diwu coco bu raxul nga jël fromage mu wecci levure bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\ndieufandiko ngun ngun bou bess diwou lin wala diwou coco bou rakhoul nga dieul fromage mou weuthi levure bi\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":855,"row":{"en":"I'm going to prescribe you some medication to help relieve the pain and inflammation.","wo":"Maa ngi lay bindal ay garab yuy féexal metit wi ak tàngooru biir bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMagui lay bindal ay garab youy fékhaleu metite wi ak tangoru biir bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":856,"row":{"en":"The article was really interesting, and it made me think about how my brain works.","wo":"Muy xët wu am solo, loolu yóbbu ma may xalaat ci ni sama xel du yuur.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoy kheut wou am solo lolou yobou ma may khalaat thi ni sama khel dou youre.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":857,"row":{"en":"The process of making pottery begins with gathering clay.","wo":"Li ngay njëkka def sooy def potëri mooy nga wut ban.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi ngay ndieukka def sooy def poteri moy nga wout ban.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":858,"row":{"en":"Last week, my uncle was out in the field harvesting corn when he spotted a snake slithering across the ground.","wo":"Ayu-bis bi weesu sama ndijaay dafa doon góob mboq, jekki saa rek mu gis benn jaan juy watatu ci suuf.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAy bis bi wessou sama ndiaay dafa done goob mbokh, djeki saa rek mou guiss beneu djane djouy watatou thi souf.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":859,"row":{"en":"Rum can be enjoyed neat, on the rocks, or mixed in cocktails.","wo":"Sula naan rhum bu noonu, wala nga boole ci ndonji glaas wala nga njaxas ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSoula nane rhum bou nonou wala nga boolé ci ndondji glaas wala nga ndiahass ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":860,"row":{"en":"I stood there, aching with pain, and wondered if I would ever get to the front.","wo":"Ma taxaw foofu, ànd ak metit, may xalaat ndax dinaa musa yegg ci kanam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa takhaw foofu andak metite may khalaate ndakh dina meussa yeugue thi kanam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":861,"row":{"en":"This particular sunset (header photo) appeared during our recent brief warm spell.","wo":"Bii jant buy so (boppu nataal bi) mingi feeñ ci sunu jamonoy tàngoor ju gàtt ju fi jaaroon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBii djant bouy soo (boppou nataal bi) mingui feegn thi souniou diamonoy tangoor djou gatt djou fi diarone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":862,"row":{"en":"Our se